{"id":"0356d8ecaaf34dec","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Order12 Wellorder Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism — ZFC Order12 Wellorder Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism — ZFC Order12 Wellorder Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism — ZFC Order12 Wellorder Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"303c0ec892c0532c\" href=\"?note=303c0ec892c0532c\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce50b9a751a8ba69\" href=\"?note=ce50b9a751a8ba69\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,W,V\\in V\">\\(f,W,V\\in V\\)</span> (map and relation graphs; relation carriers are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S\\)</span> (well-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"303c0ec892c0532c\" href=\"?note=303c0ec892c0532c\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\\)</span> (order-isomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce50b9a751a8ba69\" href=\"?note=ce50b9a751a8ba69\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S(f,W,V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W,\n\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S(f,W,V)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W,\n\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier of each relation is expanded as its domain–range union; no unbound relation-field operator is required.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"303c0ec892c0532c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce50b9a751a8ba69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"303c0ec892c0532c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S$ (well-order predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-well-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce50b9a751a8ba69","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S$ (order-isomorphism predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order11-order-isomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,W,V\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order12\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder12WellorderIsomorphism}_S(f,W,V)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{WellOrder}_S(\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11OrderIsomorphism}_S\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(W)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(W),W,\n\\operatorname{dom}(V)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(V),V).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2925","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism.md|58-df-zfc-order12-wellorder-isomorphism]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","303c0ec892c0532c","ce50b9a751a8ba69"]}